  "body": "See https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4143#discussion_r282929590\r\n\r\n> when it generates a box (i.e., is not display: none or display: contents)\r\n\r\nThis phrase is repeated a couple of times in the rendering section. It's necessary because we don't want to require things like \"behave as display: inline-block\" on elements that are display: none. But maybe it should be factored out, so it reads better and is defined once.",
